This directory contains work from three different places. They are listed
separately because the terms are not the same.


1. THE TEMPLATE
---------------
style.tex, slides.tex, README.md

    Copyright the contributors to this repository.
    Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

    You may copy, adapt and redistribute this, including commercially,
    provided you give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate
    whether you made changes.

    There is no upstream theme to credit. The palette was carried over from a
    2019 presentation by the same author; everything around it — the title
    page, the frame titles, the footline, the blocks — was written here. The
    2019 deck had been built on Overleaf's "Molecular Chemistry" example, and
    none of that survives: the layout was rewritten rather than recoloured,
    and no file from it is in this directory.


2. THE COVER IMAGE
------------------
figures/cover-oilwash.png

    A photograph taken by the author, put through a generative tool into the
    oil-wash treatment you see. Same CC BY 4.0 terms as the rest.

    It is here because a template with no cover image cannot be judged. It is
    not required: \morandiCoverArt selects the cover treatment, and four of
    its five presets are drawn rather than placed and use no image at all.
    Point \morandiartPhoto at your own file, or switch presets, and nothing
    else needs changing.


3. THE TYPEFACES
----------------
fonts/OpenSans/        the text face — body, bullets, block bodies, tables
fonts/IBMPlexSerif/    the display face — cover, dividers, frame titles

    Open Sans, copyright 2020 The Open Sans Project Authors
    (https://github.com/googlefonts/opensans).
    IBM Plex Serif, copyright 2017 IBM Corp., with Reserved Font Name "Plex".

    Both are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The full
    text of each is in OFL.txt inside its own directory.

    All files are redistributed unmodified. Four faces of each family are
    here — upright, italic, bold, bold italic — which is what this template
    loads; taking a subset is permitted and changes nothing about the terms.

    IBM's Reserved Font Name matters only if you MODIFY the font: an altered
    copy may not be distributed under the name "Plex". Shipping it as it is,
    which is what happens here, is unrestricted.

    The OFL is not CC BY and does not merge into it. It travels with the font
    files: keep these notices and the OFL.txt files with them, and do not sell
    the fonts on their own. Bundling them inside something you sell is
    allowed; selling them by themselves is not. If you swap a face out, delete
    its paragraph here along with its directory — the obligation goes with the
    files.

    NEITHER FACE CARRIES smcp. That is a fact about the files, not a licence
    term, but it is the one thing to check before replacing either: nothing in
    this template uses \textsc, and a face swapped in on the assumption that
    it does will fail silently.
